  "result": "I fixed the off-by-one in `createProject` in `src/server/services/project-service.ts`. I haven't run the test suite.\n\nThe quota check passed `0` as the number of units being requested, so it only failed once the organization was already over its limit. A free plan allows 2 projects. With 2 in use, `2 + 0 > 2` was false, so a third project was created. Only the next attempt (`3 + 0 > 2`) was blocked. I removed the `0` so the check uses the default of 1, matching the issue and webhook checks.\n\nI left the `0` in `billing-service.ts` and `change-plan.ts`. Those compare existing usage against a target plan, so `0` is correct there.",
